    /*
     * Complex-shift QR iteration on the Hessenberg matrix.  The matrix is
     * tiny, so a Givens-based implicit QR step is both simple and very fast.
     * Working in complex arithmetic avoids the special real 2x2 handling that
     * makes the classic Francis kernel error prone.
